        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "Riverbend Dental Studio — PBC Request and Client Master List Entry"
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "Prepared by: Colin Mackey, Staff Accountant | Date: June 12, 2025 | Engagement: Tax Return Preparation (1065), FY 2024"
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "1. Purpose"
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "This document serves two purposes: (a) formalizes the initial PBC (Prepared by Client) request to Riverbend Dental Studio for the upcoming tax engagement, and (b) establishes the client master list entry to be used for tracking, filing, and correspondence throughout the engagement."
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "2. Client Master List Entry"
      },
      {
        "kind": "table",
        "columns": ["Field", "Value"],
        "rows": [
          ["Client Legal Name", "Riverbend Dental Studio, LLC"],
          ["Doing Business As", "Riverbend Dental Studio"],
          ["Entity Type", "Limited Liability Company (Partnership, taxed as 1065)"],
          ["EIN", "83-4592017"],
          ["Fiscal Year End", "December 31, 2024"],
          ["Address", "1287 Riverbend Parkway, Suite 200, Springfield, IL 62704"],
          ["Primary Contact", "Dr. Elena Vasquez, Managing Member"],
          ["Contact Phone", "(217) 555-0142"],
          ["Contact Email", "e.vasquez@riverbenddental.com"],
          ["Engagement Type", "Federal Form 1065 and State IL-1065 preparation"],
          ["Engagement Period", "January 1, 2024 – December 31, 2024"],
          ["Partner Responsible", "M. Alvarez"],
          ["Staff Assigned", "C. Mackey"],
          ["Initial Setup Date", "June 12, 2025"],
          ["Status", "Active — awaiting initial PBC responses"]
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "3. PBC Request — Items Required"
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "The following items are requested from Riverbend Dental Studio to commence the 2024 tax preparation work. Please provide all items no later than July 10, 2025, unless otherwise noted."
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "3.1 Financial Records"
      },
      {
        "kind": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "items": [
          "Complete trial balance as of December 31, 2024, with supporting general ledger detail (electronic copy preferred).",
          "Profit & Loss statement and Balance Sheet for FY 2024, both accrual and cash basis if maintained.",
          "Prior year (2023) tax return — Form 1065 and all supporting schedules, if prepared by another firm.",
          "Bank statements for all business accounts (checking, savings, money market) for January–December 2024.",
          "Credit card statements for all business credit cards for January–December 2024.",
          "Loan statements and amortization schedules for any outstanding debt as of December 31, 2024.",
          "Fixed asset listing with acquisition dates, costs, and accumulated depreciation through December 31, 2024."
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "3.2 Income & Expense Documentation"
      },
      {
        "kind": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "items": [
          "1099-NEC and 1099-MISC forms received from vendors and payors, if any, for tax year 2024.",
          "1098 forms for mortgage interest, if the business owns real property with a mortgage.",
          "Annual merchant services / credit card processing fee statements (e.g., Square, Stripe, or bank processor).",
          "Detailed schedule of all professional fees paid (legal, accounting, consulting) during 2024.",
          "Insurance policies and premium payment records for 2024 (malpractice, property, general liability, workers' comp).",
          "Rent agreements and total rent paid for the office location, including CAM charges, if applicable.",
          "Payroll summary reports (941s, state unemployment filings, and W-3/W-2s) for all employees for 2024."
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "3.3 Partner & Ownership Information"
      },
      {
        "kind": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "items": [
          "List of all members/partners with ownership percentages and capital account activity for 2024.",
          "K-1 information for each partner: name, address, SSN/EIN, and any guaranteed payments made.",
          "Schedule of any distributions (cash or property) made to partners during 2024.",
          "Copies of the Operating Agreement and any amendments effective during 2024."
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "3.4 Other"
      },
      {
        "kind": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "items": [
          "Copy of the prior year's Schedule K-1s (2023), if applicable, for basis carryforward work.",
          "Any correspondence from the IRS or Illinois Department of Revenue regarding the entity.",
          "Authorization to electronically file (Form 8879-P will be provided for signature at filing time).",
          "Completed engagement acceptance questionnaire (attached separately) confirming no changes to ownership or business activity."
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "4. Submission Instructions"
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "Please upload all documents to the secure client portal (link sent separately) or email encrypted files to c.mackey@firm.com. If you prefer to deliver physical copies, please coordinate with our front desk to arrange a drop-off. If any item is not applicable or not available, please indicate so in writing when responding."
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "5. Next Steps"
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "Upon receipt of the requested items, we will begin the trial balance tie-out and account analysis. We anticipate completing the draft return by August 15, 2025, and will schedule a review call with Dr. Vasquez in late August to discuss any findings or questions."
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "If you have any questions regarding this request, please contact Colin Mackey at (217) 555-0187 or c.mackey@firm.com. We appreciate your prompt attention to this matter."
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "Colin Mackey\nStaff Accountant"
      }
    ]
  }
}
